center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 暗影之拥.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4b/nateftbhouphijs89ph09pu3t1t9bgc.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E4%B9%8B%E6%8B%A5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/4/4b/nateftbhouphijs89ph09pu3t1t9bgc.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%9A%97%E5%BD%B1%E4%B9%8B%E6%8B%A5.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/4/4b/nateftbhouphijs89ph09pu3t1t9bgc.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />暗影领域•命运遮蔽\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>0-0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>5\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"魔法强化\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">魔法强化</font></span></span>]，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">60%</font>范围伤害，并施加随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级减益</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼伤害2</font></span></span>]，持续2回合；<br />✦治疗范围内己方，治疗量为魔攻值的<font color=\"#58cb48\">60%</font>，驱散2个减益，并使其获得随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级增益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级增益</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害3</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免疫冰火地形\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">免疫冰火地形</font></span></span>]，持续2回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 0-0 5.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/ca/0uppue16lvzc7kjkz0rg37ccqxznm9k.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_0-0_5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/ca/0uppue16lvzc7kjkz0rg37ccqxznm9k.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style